# Implementation Plan: Farmer Product Listing Module

This document outlines the architecture and execution strategy for building the Farmer Product Listing module in AgriChain, featuring a multi-step form, live preview, auto-saving, and blockchain integration.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Blockchain Details Generation**: The requirement states "Generate Blockchain Record". For this implementation, I will mock the blockchain transaction hash and product ID generation in the backend on successful publishing (as true blockchain interactions typically require smart contracts which are out of scope here). Let me know if you need actual smart contract interaction.
> - **Location (GPS)**: I will integrate standard browser Geolocation APIs to fetch coordinates and reverse geocoding via an open API (like OpenStreetMap Nominatim) or just allow manual entry.
> - **Auto-save**: Auto-save will store draft data locally (using `localStorage` or `sessionStorage`) every 30 seconds to prevent data loss.

## Open Questions

