## Proposed Changes

---

### Backend (Rust + Axum + MongoDB)

#### [NEW] `src/models/product.rs`
- Define the `Product` struct matching the MongoDB collection fields: `_id`, `product_id`, `wallet_address`, `farmer_id`, `product_name`, `category`, `sub_category`, `variety`, `description`, `quantity`, `unit`, `price`, `market_price`, `discount_price`, `negotiable`, `organic` (boolean), `certificate` (Option<String>), `harvest_date`, `expiry_date`, `availability` (from/until/min/max), `delivery_options` (pickup/home/radius/transport), `quality` (freshness, moisture, storage), `images` (Vec<String>), `location` (village, city, district, state, country, pin, lat, lng), `status` (Draft, Published, etc.), `blockchain_hash`, `qr_code`, `created_at`, `updated_at`.

#### [MODIFY] `src/models/dto.rs`
- Add `CreateProductDto`, `UpdateProductDto`, `ProductResponseDto`.

#### [NEW] `src/controllers/product.rs`
- Implement handlers for:
  - `POST /api/products`: Create product (handles both draft saves and publishing).
  - `GET /api/products`: List all products (with pagination/filters).
  - `GET /api/products/:id`: Get a specific product.
  - `PUT /api/products/:id`: Update product.
  - `DELETE /api/products/:id`: Delete product.
  - `GET /api/products/farmer`: Get products for the authenticated farmer.
  - `PATCH /api/products/:id/status`: Update status (e.g., Draft -> Published).
  - `PATCH /api/products/:id/stock`: Update stock quantities.

#### [NEW] `src/routes/product.rs`
- Define routes for the product controller endpoints.

#### [MODIFY] `src/routes/mod.rs` & `src/models/mod.rs` & `src/controllers/mod.rs`
- Register `product` module in respective mod files.

