## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
1. Access `/farmer/products/add` as a Farmer with a complete profile.
2. Ensure incomplete profiles are redirected back to `/farmer/complete-profile`.
3. Walk through the 5 steps, ensuring validation works on each step before proceeding.
4. Upload images and confirm previews render correctly.
5. Wait 30 seconds to verify auto-save draft functionality via `localStorage`.
6. Submit the product, verifying the backend returns a mocked blockchain hash.
7. Confirm redirection to the Success page and rendering of the QR Code.
